{{!--
  Where the reader of an account email gets help.

  On a self-hosted server (isSelfHosted, set by MailService.render from
  Utils/EmailServerKind.ts) it is the server's own admin, in the words the
  self-hosted welcome uses (SignupAccountReadyEmail): OneUptime's support
  cannot help with somebody's own server (#8190). The line names no product
  and no outside address, so a renamed server shows it too.

  An invitation names who sent it (inviterName, InviteMember and
  Server/Utils/TeamMember/InvitationInviter): on a self-hosted server they
  are asked first, then the server's admin (#7471). Their name is their
  own words, so it is printed escaped.

  On OneUptime Cloud it is OneUptime's support, unless the installation goes
  by another name (isBrandRenamed), which leaves the block out.

  In the email's language (Notification/Utils/EmailLanguage): each line is
  looked up whole by its English, the inviter's name put in as written.
  English reads exactly as it always did.
--}}
{{#if @root.isSelfHosted}}
<table role="presentation" class="st-Copy st-Width st-Width--mobile" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width: 100%; table-layout: fixed;">
  <tr><td class="st-Gutter " style="padding: 0 40px 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: #475569; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">
    {{#if @root.inviterName}}{{tt "Need help? Ask {{inviter}}, who invited you, or your server's admin." inviter=@root.inviterName}}{{else}}{{t "Need help? Ask your server's admin."}}{{/if}}
  </td></tr>
</table>
{{else}}{{#unless @root.isBrandRenamed}}
<table role="presentation" class="st-Copy st-Width st-Width--mobile" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="width: 100%; table-layout: fixed;">
  <tr><td class="st-Gutter " style="padding: 0 40px 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 24px; color: #475569; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word;">
    {{t "Need help?"}} <a href="mailto:support@oneuptime.com" style="color: #111111; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;">{{t "Contact support"}}</a>
  </td></tr>
</table>
{{/unless}}{{/if}}
